WEBVTT

00:21.020 --> 00:25.110
<b>Arale Nakamachi</b>

00:28.280 --> 00:29.860
<b>Manager:
Meeting's starting</b>

00:36.580 --> 00:38.080
<b>I tried sending her a text...</b>

00:38.370 --> 00:40.080
<b>She's not usually late.</b>

00:40.210 --> 00:41.920
<b>Sorry, I'm late.</b>

00:42.040 --> 00:46.050
<b>A few things came up,
and I lost track of time.</b>

00:46.260 --> 00:49.220
<b>Oh no! What's wrong, Arale-chan?</b>

00:49.340 --> 00:52.260
<b>My throat's a bit sore.</b>

00:52.390 --> 00:56.310
<b>Oh, I see. I'll tell you
the cough drops I use later.</b>

00:56.470 --> 00:58.310
<b>Thank you.</b>

00:58.430 --> 01:01.270
<b>Everyone's here,
so let's start the meeting.</b>

01:01.400 --> 01:02.690
<b>Okay.</b>

01:02.810 --> 01:06.480
<b>As I mentioned earlier,
Fuji-san has to head back to work,</b>

01:06.940 --> 01:09.070
<b>so let's discuss the livestream first.</b>

01:09.190 --> 01:10.610
<b>Yay!</b>

01:11.610 --> 01:13.910
<b>I thought you hated live shows.</b>

01:14.660 --> 01:17.330
<b>I think it's time
to start moving forward.</b>

01:17.450 --> 01:19.370
<b>I'll practice hard.</b>

01:19.500 --> 01:21.040
<b>That's the spirit!</b>

01:21.160 --> 01:23.630
<b>Fuji-san, where are you
with the deadline?</b>

01:23.750 --> 01:25.710
<b>- I'm okay.
- That's good.</b>

01:26.170 --> 01:29.260
<b>Let's go over the schedule later,
just in case.</b>

01:29.380 --> 01:30.550
<b>Okay.</b>

01:32.550 --> 01:35.220
<b>I can compose,
but what about the lyrics?</b>

01:35.550 --> 01:37.930
<b>Can you write them, Nakamachi-san?</b>

01:38.850 --> 01:40.140
<b>Guess that's a no.</b>

01:40.270 --> 01:43.440
<b>It's a shame.
I really like your lyrics...</b>

01:43.560 --> 01:45.940
<b>I'll ask one of our in-house writers.</b>

01:46.520 --> 01:49.690
<b>Sorry, I need to take
some time off from practice.</b>

01:50.110 --> 01:51.320
<b>What?</b>

01:52.700 --> 01:54.620
<b>Something's definitely wrong.</b>

01:54.820 --> 01:56.410
<b>Do you guys know anything?</b>

01:57.370 --> 01:58.870
<b>I don't, sorry.</b>

02:01.200 --> 02:03.580
<b>Maybe her issues got even worse.</b>

02:23.940 --> 02:28.520
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype</i></b>

02:29.730 --> 02:34.110
<b><i>The story always revolves around us</i></b>

02:34.450 --> 02:38.950
<b><i>That may be a given But let me repeat it</i></b>

02:39.450 --> 02:44.370
<b><i>Can you read the guidelines?
No matter how carefully we write them</i></b>

02:44.580 --> 02:49.380
<b><i>Why does something always get in the way?
Still, we'll make it roar!</i></b>

02:49.500 --> 02:53.340
<b><i>In a heartbeat, like an overdrive</i></b>

02:53.470 --> 03:00.100
<b><i>We yearn to distort the world we see</i></b>

03:00.260 --> 03:04.890
<b><i>Seeing too clearly makes innocence
seem ridiculous, what a joke!</i></b>

03:05.270 --> 03:09.770
<b><i>Even vain attempts at being brave
Will be rewarded when the time comes</i></b>

03:10.070 --> 03:13.780
<b><i>This is the plot of our survival</i></b>

03:14.030 --> 03:19.450
<b><i>Rewriting the tale
Shedding absurd tears, the newtype way</i></b>

03:19.570 --> 03:24.410
<b><i>We can go anywhere, we can, so don't stop now</i></b>

03:24.540 --> 03:28.790
<b><i>Not an anime, not real either,
let's make our own category</i></b>

03:28.920 --> 03:32.000
<b><i>We've grown tired
of this complicated, dull world!</i></b>

03:32.130 --> 03:35.510
<b><i>Leave it to us, we'll write our own dreams</i></b>

03:35.630 --> 03:38.800
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype, our choice</i></b>

03:38.930 --> 03:40.390
<b><i>Following the steady beat</i></b>

03:40.510 --> 03:45.890
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype</i></b>

04:03.870 --> 04:06.500
<b>I played it without messing up!</b>

04:07.000 --> 04:10.080
<b>Yuno-chan, how did I do today?</b>

04:10.960 --> 04:13.300
<b>- Average.
- Yay!</b>

04:13.420 --> 04:16.880
<b>Was today's practice even worth it?</b>

04:17.470 --> 04:20.760
<b>Both the manager and Fuji-san
have other plans.</b>

04:21.260 --> 04:25.100
<b>Besides your usual deadline,
you have to work on the book.</b>

04:25.220 --> 04:26.810
<b>I'm very sorry.</b>

04:26.930 --> 04:32.230
<b>I need to take care of this first
so I can focus fully on band practice.</b>

04:32.810 --> 04:35.150
<b>Being a manga artist must be tough.</b>

04:35.280 --> 04:36.490
<b>Of course.</b>

04:36.610 --> 04:40.530
<b>But the bags under her eyes
are smaller now,</b>

04:40.660 --> 04:43.200
<b>so she seems healthier than before.</b>

04:43.330 --> 04:45.450
<b>Yeah? Then I guess she's okay.</b>

04:45.580 --> 04:49.000
<b>That's something only Miyako-chan knows.</b>

04:49.120 --> 04:50.620
<b>Which is it?</b>

04:55.670 --> 04:57.880
<b>- Oh, Arale-chan.
- What is it?</b>

04:58.170 --> 05:01.970
<b>I didn't know your friends
from the other day were in a group.</b>

05:02.090 --> 05:03.010
<b>Oh, really?</b>

05:03.140 --> 05:06.680
<b>- It popped up in my feed.
- It makes sense. They're cute.</b>

05:06.890 --> 05:07.810
<b>Yeah.</b>

05:07.930 --> 05:11.020
<b>- Look.
- They're having an event this weekend.</b>

05:10.520 --> 05:12.850
<b>Fairy Bouquet First Visual Book Event</b>

05:11.140 --> 05:12.850
<b>It's at Suzunare.</b>

05:13.230 --> 05:14.940
<b>Are you going, Arale-chan?</b>

05:15.070 --> 05:17.980
<b>They're airing
the full Magilulu series this weekend.</b>

05:18.110 --> 05:21.320
<b>Did you see the new character
for the next movie?</b>

05:21.450 --> 05:22.240
<b>I did!</b>

05:22.410 --> 05:24.320
<b>I can't wait to watch it.</b>

05:24.450 --> 05:26.410
<b>I should rewatch the first one.</b>

05:26.540 --> 05:27.540
<b>You're right.</b>

05:27.660 --> 05:30.620
<b>- See you.
- Bye-bye.</b>

05:31.000 --> 05:32.580
<b>Shall we head out too?</b>

05:32.710 --> 05:35.040
<b>Arale-chan!</b>

05:36.960 --> 05:38.050
<b>Ouch.</b>

05:38.170 --> 05:39.510
<b>There you are!</b>

05:39.630 --> 05:40.720
<b>Nono-chan-san...</b>

05:40.920 --> 05:43.800
<b>I came to talk to you, Arale-chan.</b>

05:45.430 --> 05:48.770
<b>I'm sorry for how I acted
during band practice.</b>

05:48.890 --> 05:50.230
<b>It's nothing serious,</b>

05:50.350 --> 05:53.440
<b>but I always feel kind of bad
just sitting there.</b>

05:53.560 --> 05:57.360
<b>I also let my homework pile up.
Studying's our duty, right?</b>

05:57.650 --> 06:00.070
<b>So I thought I should do that first.</b>

06:00.190 --> 06:01.320
<b>- Arale-chan!
- Yes?!</b>

06:01.490 --> 06:05.320
<b>A squeeze or a smooch?</b>

06:06.580 --> 06:08.240
<b>- Huh?
- A squeeze?</b>

06:08.370 --> 06:09.790
<b>A smooch?</b>

06:09.910 --> 06:11.000
<b>A hug?</b>

06:12.460 --> 06:13.460
<b>A smooch?</b>

06:13.580 --> 06:15.460
<b>A squeeze? A sneeze?</b>

06:15.830 --> 06:18.880
<b>Oh no, my train! Excuse me!</b>

06:21.880 --> 06:24.180
<b>Oh no, oh no, oh no!</b>

06:24.550 --> 06:28.640
<b>That's Nono-chan-san's first aid.
She noticed.</b>

06:32.100 --> 06:33.390
<b>It still hurts.</b>

06:34.230 --> 06:37.730
<b>I thought it might heal
if I just gave it time,</b>

06:38.020 --> 06:39.520
<b>but it won't.</b>

06:40.480 --> 06:46.360
<b>I thought I was doing a little better
with everyone's help.</b>

06:47.280 --> 06:51.540
<b>Things that happened in the past...
and even yesterday...</b>

06:57.170 --> 06:58.960
<b>It's all so confusing.</b>

07:07.340 --> 07:10.510
<b>This is a first for you, Ritsu.</b>

07:10.640 --> 07:14.390
<b>You're usually
the cool prince, Clematis.</b>

07:14.520 --> 07:17.230
<b>I guess this one's a rare shot.</b>

07:20.270 --> 07:23.900
<b>Hey, can I get one with a smile too?</b>

07:24.690 --> 07:26.660
<b>Ritsu?</b>

07:26.950 --> 07:30.080
<b>Are you not listening?</b>

07:32.450 --> 07:34.120
<b>You're no fun.</b>

07:35.410 --> 07:40.710
<b>If you're not going to talk to me,
I'll go to your precious Arale-chan...</b>

07:42.800 --> 07:44.090
<b>I like that face.</b>

07:45.300 --> 07:48.930
<b>Keep it up, and let's do our best
at tomorrow's event.</b>

07:49.300 --> 07:50.510
<b>Yes.</b>

07:53.520 --> 07:56.480
<b>It's our very first event.</b>

07:57.350 --> 07:59.730
<b>We want lots of people to come.</b>

08:00.440 --> 08:01.400
<b>Yes.</b>

08:01.520 --> 08:05.360
<b>Ritsu, don't forget the announcement
in today's livestream.</b>

08:05.490 --> 08:09.280
<b>I've sent you a setlist
that matches Fairy Bouquet's vibe.</b>

08:09.410 --> 08:10.530
<b>Okay.</b>

08:10.660 --> 08:12.200
<b>Good girl.</b>

08:13.080 --> 08:14.700
<b>You're so smart.</b>

08:15.080 --> 08:18.160
<b>Nothing like Arale-chan.</b>

08:22.210 --> 08:23.800
<b>Thank you.</b>

08:24.380 --> 08:28.050
<b>Tomorrow at 1 PM, the Fairy Bouquet
First Visual Book Event</b>

08:28.170 --> 08:32.390
<b>will be held at Suzunare,
in the event space on the first floor.</b>

08:32.510 --> 08:36.470
<b>The event is free,
so we'd be delighted if you could come.</b>

08:36.980 --> 08:41.560
<b>I look forward to seeing you
at the venue. Thank you.</b>

08:43.480 --> 08:46.070
<b>Well done! You really are a good girl!</b>

09:21.440 --> 09:24.650
<b>She forgot to turn it off?
It should've ended</b>

09:25.060 --> 09:26.650
<b>What's this?</b>

09:27.610 --> 09:30.990
<b>I mixed up my main
and private accounts!</b>

09:31.110 --> 09:33.700
<b>Ah, well. I'll just have to apologize.</b>

09:33.820 --> 09:37.490
<b>Viola, look.
She's doing something interesting.</b>

09:37.620 --> 09:41.000
<b>I'm watching it. Oh, Ritsu...</b>

09:41.460 --> 09:44.710
<b>She's playing Arale-chan's song.</b>

09:44.880 --> 09:47.710
<b>Playing an old song?
What's the agency doing?</b>

09:53.180 --> 09:57.350
<b>"Clematis forgot to end her livestream."</b>

09:57.760 --> 10:00.480
<b>"She's playing Erea's song"?</b>

10:00.640 --> 10:02.310
<b>"Erea," you say?</b>

10:02.850 --> 10:08.780
<b>Look here, Clematis!
Can't believe she's playing "Just me Unlimited"</b>

10:07.400 --> 10:08.780
<b>Geez...</b>

10:09.150 --> 10:13.740
<b>This is seriously messed up...</b>

10:16.160 --> 10:18.160
<b>What's this? What song is it?</b>

10:18.410 --> 10:20.950
<b>That one, right? Arale-chan's song.</b>

10:21.080 --> 10:23.330
<b>Wow, she's so passionate.</b>

10:23.460 --> 10:26.790
<b>Did she forget to end it,
or is it on purpose?</b>

10:27.920 --> 10:30.670
<b>I'm sorry to bother you at this hour.</b>

10:30.920 --> 10:32.170
<b>Yes, that's right.</b>

10:32.300 --> 10:37.180
<b>Clematis's livestream is part
of the promotion for tomorrow's event.</b>

10:37.350 --> 10:44.310
<b>Fairy Bouquet Clematis Guitar Livestream</b>

10:38.100 --> 10:41.060
<b>Yes. She's just acting like she forgot.</b>

10:41.270 --> 10:45.230
<b>I'm sorry for not
letting you know sooner.</b>

10:46.270 --> 10:49.940
<b>Yes, all right. Please excuse me.</b>

10:59.530 --> 11:01.120
<b>Arale-chan...</b>

11:04.830 --> 11:07.670
<b>That love song for Arale-chan
moved us all</b>

11:08.590 --> 11:09.380
<b>What did I do?</b>

11:09.540 --> 11:11.800
<b>Hey, the stream's still going</b>

11:13.840 --> 11:15.180
<b>End livestream</b>

11:24.390 --> 11:26.810
<b>They heard everything?</b>

11:27.810 --> 11:28.900
<b>Arale-chan.</b>

11:29.020 --> 11:32.940
<b>But if your old fans see you,
things could get messy...</b>

11:33.070 --> 11:33.940
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

11:34.110 --> 11:35.740
<b>We'll still be friends forever.</b>

11:35.860 --> 11:38.660
<b>Was it MewType?</b>

11:38.780 --> 11:39.570
<b>She'll drag us down...</b>

11:39.740 --> 11:40.830
<b>The leader...</b>

11:40.950 --> 11:44.500
<b>Using your real name
can be dangerous, you know.</b>

11:44.620 --> 11:47.500
<b>Dreams are power!</b>

11:48.880 --> 11:51.040
<b>Magilulu for short.</b>

11:52.300 --> 11:53.500
<b>Let's sing together.</b>

11:53.630 --> 11:55.380
<b>Well done.</b>

11:58.010 --> 11:59.430
<b>Please...</b>

12:00.470 --> 12:04.310
<b>Please... I don't want anything
to happen to Arale-chan.</b>

12:07.600 --> 12:11.310
<b>This livestream has ended</b>

12:08.900 --> 12:10.310
<b>Why?</b>

12:13.940 --> 12:15.900
<b>I shouldn't have watched it.</b>

12:17.240 --> 12:18.570
<b>Why did she do that?</b>

12:19.490 --> 12:20.820
<b>Arale-chan.</b>

12:24.950 --> 12:26.700
<b>I get it now.</b>

12:27.830 --> 12:28.960
<b>"Help me."</b>

12:30.420 --> 12:32.500
<b>That's what you wanted to say.</b>

12:33.090 --> 12:34.710
<b>Now I know.</b>

12:35.420 --> 12:39.590
<b>You had the same expression
I had back then.</b>

12:46.600 --> 12:49.100
<b>Some weirdo showed up at school</b>

12:49.390 --> 12:51.940
<b>Your singing is gross</b>

12:55.110 --> 12:56.820
<b>Arale-chan.</b>

13:02.620 --> 13:05.870
<b>I really enjoyed
your livestream yesterday.</b>

13:06.040 --> 13:08.870
<b>Even "Arale-chan" was trending.</b>

13:09.000 --> 13:11.290
<b>- Really?
- Everyone was talking about it.</b>

13:11.420 --> 13:16.300
<b>A lot of people want to check out
today's event, since it's a hot topic.</b>

13:16.420 --> 13:19.010
<b>It'll be a chance to get some new fans!</b>

13:19.130 --> 13:23.300
<b>I ate too many sweets yesterday.
Now my face is all puffy.</b>

13:23.430 --> 13:24.850
<b>Looks the same to me.</b>

13:27.060 --> 13:31.520
<b>Thanks to Ritsu, today's event
is getting a lot of attention,</b>

13:31.640 --> 13:35.690
<b>but the event itself needs
a bit more twists and turns.</b>

13:35.820 --> 13:39.900
<b>Ritsu, if you'd told us beforehand,
we could've done a lot more.</b>

13:40.400 --> 13:45.410
<b>Getting people talking is important,
but we want to be more than a hot topic.</b>

13:45.530 --> 13:48.290
<b>There it is. Viola's content theory.</b>

14:08.600 --> 14:09.810
<b>Arale-chan.</b>

14:16.520 --> 14:19.280
<b>There's nothing I can do.</b>

14:20.900 --> 14:22.740
<b>I learned that the hard way.</b>

14:24.160 --> 14:28.200
<b>I can also feel how much
she's crying out for help.</b>

14:29.620 --> 14:30.660
<b>But...</b>

14:31.580 --> 14:33.460
<b>What should I do?</b>

14:34.370 --> 14:35.420
<b>I have no idea...</b>

14:36.210 --> 14:37.540
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

14:47.100 --> 14:51.680
<b>"Fairy Bouquet First Visual Book."</b>

14:51.970 --> 14:54.140
<b>Is this the venue?! Why am I here?!</b>

14:54.270 --> 14:57.520
<b>Hello! We're Fairy Bouquet.</b>

14:58.900 --> 15:03.070
<b>Thank you so much for coming today.</b>

15:03.190 --> 15:05.200
<b>This is our very first event!</b>

15:05.320 --> 15:06.570
<b>I'm Viola, the leader.</b>

15:07.660 --> 15:09.910
<b>Right? Check! Left? Check!</b>

15:10.030 --> 15:14.040
<b>I'm Bell from Fairy Bouquet!
Hello, everyone!</b>

15:14.410 --> 15:17.920
<b>I'm Popo. Please enjoy yourselves today!</b>

15:19.130 --> 15:22.550
<b>I'm Clematis. Thank you for coming.</b>

15:25.220 --> 15:27.640
<b>I can't believe so many people came!</b>

15:28.850 --> 15:30.390
<b>Ricchan...</b>

15:30.850 --> 15:32.970
<b>So many real people!</b>

15:33.100 --> 15:34.310
<b>What are you saying?</b>

15:34.430 --> 15:36.440
<b>I can't do anything...</b>

15:36.560 --> 15:39.940
<b>We have a Q&A segment
and a meet-and-greet!</b>

15:40.060 --> 15:42.570
<b>We've got tons of stuff lined up.</b>

15:42.900 --> 15:45.360
<b>But first, we have a major announcement!</b>

15:46.530 --> 15:49.200
<b>Thanks to everyone's support,</b>

15:49.660 --> 15:52.580
<b>we're going to release
our very first single!</b>

15:59.540 --> 16:03.130
<b>Erea-chan! Thank you for coming!</b>

16:05.970 --> 16:07.800
<b>It's been so long!</b>

16:07.930 --> 16:10.550
<b>I never thought you'd come...</b>

16:10.680 --> 16:12.930
<b>I'm honestly so happy.</b>

16:13.430 --> 16:16.680
<b>Hey, since you're here,
why don't you come over?</b>

16:17.480 --> 16:21.270
<b>There's something I've been
wanting to say for a long time.</b>

16:21.940 --> 16:25.780
<b>Erea-chan...
I guess you're Arale-chan now.</b>

16:26.190 --> 16:27.030
<b>Viola!</b>

16:27.150 --> 16:29.950
<b>I know, Clematis.</b>

16:30.070 --> 16:35.290
<b>You really want to make up
with Arale-chan too, right?</b>

16:35.410 --> 16:38.460
<b>I realized that
during your livestream yesterday.</b>

16:39.290 --> 16:40.120
<b>That's why...</b>

16:40.460 --> 16:43.750
<b>I want you and Arale-chan to make up.</b>

16:44.800 --> 16:48.930
<b>Let's sing that song from yesterday
together and be friends again.</b>

16:49.340 --> 16:52.140
<b>I feel so honored
to witness this moment.</b>

16:52.260 --> 16:56.770
<b>These two used to be friends,
but they had a fight and drifted apart.</b>

16:56.930 --> 16:58.100
<b>Viola, don't...</b>

16:58.230 --> 17:00.140
<b>Wait, I'll bring the guitar.</b>

17:00.270 --> 17:02.020
<b>A surprise performance?</b>

17:02.150 --> 17:03.940
<b>That's the fun part of events!</b>

17:04.070 --> 17:05.360
<b>Arale-chan.</b>

17:13.780 --> 17:14.620
<b>Fairy Bouquet</b>

17:47.320 --> 17:49.610
<b>This is unfair...</b>

17:50.950 --> 17:54.700
<b>Arale-chan, how could you...</b>

18:08.340 --> 18:09.710
<b>Arale-chan.</b>

18:53.170 --> 18:54.800
<b>What am I doing?!</b>

18:54.970 --> 18:57.430
<b>I pulled you away from the event!</b>

18:57.600 --> 19:00.140
<b>I poached you? Snatched you? Stole you?</b>

19:00.310 --> 19:02.180
<b>I'm a robber?!</b>

19:02.350 --> 19:04.980
<b>What do I do? I might get sued!</b>

19:05.100 --> 19:09.190
<b>How did it come to this?
I really messed up.</b>

19:11.360 --> 19:14.450
<b>I'm scared... What should I do?</b>

19:14.700 --> 19:19.370
<b>I'm completely lost...
How did it turn out like this?</b>

19:19.530 --> 19:23.250
<b>What should I do, Ricchan?
This isn't like me...</b>

19:25.080 --> 19:28.080
<b>I think you should go back...</b>

19:30.840 --> 19:33.050
<b>You saved me.</b>

19:33.880 --> 19:35.220
<b>Thank you.</b>

19:41.970 --> 19:42.890
<b>Arale-chan.</b>

19:43.470 --> 19:46.020
<b>Did you just talk like your old self?</b>

19:46.270 --> 19:47.690
<b>What?</b>

19:47.940 --> 19:49.270
<b>Did I?</b>

19:49.810 --> 19:52.690
<b>My old self...? Did I really?</b>

19:52.820 --> 19:53.940
<b>Yeah.</b>

19:54.280 --> 19:57.450
<b>Lately, you've sounded like a stranger.</b>

19:57.570 --> 20:02.950
<b>I thought I had to change,
so I forced myself to.</b>

20:08.330 --> 20:09.460
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

20:11.630 --> 20:16.220
<b>I kept telling myself
that you were happy now</b>

20:16.760 --> 20:20.220
<b>and tried not to think about
it too much.</b>

20:22.390 --> 20:25.850
<b>Honestly, I'm still scared.</b>

20:26.680 --> 20:30.350
<b>I'm scared of getting
involved with Viola.</b>

20:31.400 --> 20:36.900
<b>I still care too much
about what other people think.</b>

20:38.070 --> 20:41.780
<b>That's why I wanted to help you.</b>

20:41.990 --> 20:45.290
<b>I just didn't know what to do.</b>

20:45.410 --> 20:47.910
<b>But I never meant to do what I did.</b>

20:48.040 --> 20:50.540
<b>I don't know how I'm going to fix this.</b>

20:51.920 --> 20:53.380
<b>We'll find a way.</b>

20:59.470 --> 21:03.430
<b>I'm always messing up.</b>

21:04.010 --> 21:06.810
<b>Even now, I'm still doing it all wrong.</b>

21:06.930 --> 21:09.060
<b>- Me too.
- What?</b>

21:09.190 --> 21:14.020
<b>But it's okay to make mistakes.</b>

21:15.730 --> 21:21.660
<b>Even if I mess up, being with you
makes me feel stronger.</b>

21:24.200 --> 21:26.160
<b>I may make a lot of mistakes,</b>

21:27.540 --> 21:29.660
<b>but I'm still me.</b>

21:30.750 --> 21:33.130
<b>I'll choose to do what I want to do.</b>

21:39.670 --> 21:40.720
<b>Yeah.</b>

21:55.980 --> 22:03.700
<b><i>Why can birds fly through the sky?
Why are cats always asleep?</i></b>

22:03.820 --> 22:07.490
<b><i>How will you live today?</i></b>

22:07.620 --> 22:15.500
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

22:19.710 --> 22:27.300
<b><i>Why does the morning sun kiss my skin?
Why does the night leave me feeling down?</i></b>

22:27.430 --> 22:35.650
<b><i>If only we could split our sorrows in half
Wouldn't that be great?</i></b>

22:35.770 --> 22:43.490
<b><i>Laughter and worry interweave
In a corner of this vast world</i></b>

22:43.650 --> 22:52.000
<b><i>Come with us
To uncover the wonders of the universe</i></b>

22:53.040 --> 23:00.750
<b><i>What stories shall we share today?
What melodies shall we sing?</i></b>

23:00.880 --> 23:04.590
<b><i>Even flowers as yet unseen</i></b>

23:04.720 --> 23:11.970
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

23:12.680 --> 23:19.730
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

23:25.860 --> 23:28.870
<b>That was Sakasete Radio,
from Fairy Bouquet.</b>

23:28.990 --> 23:31.450
<b>The one who got
the spicy one this week is...</b>

23:31.580 --> 23:34.500
<b>It's Bell, with my good looks
and good taste!</b>

23:34.620 --> 23:36.620
<b>And now, from Fairy Bouquet...</b>

23:36.750 --> 23:39.670
<b>"The Bouquet's Ribbon is Your Color."</b>

23:37.000 --> 23:39.880
<b>Destiny</b>
